Upstream project
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Multi-Tofu is an independent macOS port of Dosoft, a Dofus multi-account window
switcher for Windows.

  Project : https://github.com/LuframeCode/dosoft
  Site    : https://www.dosoft.fr
  Licence : Apache License 2.0

What comes from upstream

  - The product concept and feature design: instant switch, character wheel,
    team split.
  - The class artwork in multitofu/assets/skin and the interface sounds in
    multitofu/assets/sounds, redistributed unmodified under the Apache 2.0
    licence the upstream project publishes them under.
  - The account model: window title parsing into pseudo plus class, per
    character active flag, team assignment, custom rotation order, leader focus.

What is new here

  - Every line of platform code. Upstream targets the Win32 API (win32gui,
    SetForegroundWindow, keyboard hooks, WinRT toast notifications), none of
    which exists on macOS. This port uses the Accessibility API for window
    discovery and focus, a CGEventTap for global shortcuts, and AppKit for the
    menu bar item, the radial wheel overlay and the preferences window.
  - Shortcuts stored as physical keycodes, so a bind survives an AZERTY to
    QWERTY switch.
  - The app icon, the wheel artwork and palette, and DofusMock.app under tools/.
  - The English, French, Spanish and Portuguese interface strings.

