Third-party artwork
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The class icons and interface sounds depict content from DOFUS, a game
published by Ankama Games. They are included here because the upstream project
publishes them under Apache 2.0, and are used only to identify a player's own
characters inside their own game client.

Multi-Tofu is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Ankama Games.
DOFUS and all related names and artwork are the property of Ankama Games.

If you represent Ankama and want these assets removed, open an issue or contact
the repository owner and they will be taken out. The application falls back to a
neutral icon for any class whose artwork is missing, so removal does not break
it.
